WEBVTT

00:58:58.632 --> 00:59:01.568
CA: Liz, you're really phenomenal.

00:59:01.592 --> 00:59:03.767
You've just got this unique way

00:59:03.791 --> 00:59:06.315
of articulating
what others can't articulate,

00:59:06.339 --> 00:59:12.213
and you've brought all of us
to a very tender, intimate place,

00:59:12.237 --> 00:59:14.008
and thank you for that.

00:59:14.771 --> 00:59:16.096
EG: Thank you, Chris.

00:59:16.120 --> 00:59:17.271
HW: Thank you so much.

00:59:17.295 --> 00:59:18.547
EG: And thank you, Helen.

00:59:18.571 --> 00:59:20.713
Take care of yourselves, everybody.

00:59:21.287 --> 00:59:23.434
We're right here
with each other through this.

00:59:23.458 --> 00:59:24.609
We can do this.

00:59:24.633 --> 00:59:26.953
CA: Thank you, Liz. Goodbye.
HW: Thank you.

00:59:29.658 --> 00:59:31.160
CA: Oof.
HW: Oof.